5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to be realistic about our staffing. I'll check the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm looking at the past. I'll take the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme and those two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to see the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look at the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
